    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madman\u2019s Maze is a first-person narrative and survival experience. Explore a vast labyrinth filled with traps, enemies and secrets as you face the horrors of a disturbed mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae More than 10 chapters with unique mechanics, puzzles, enemies and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Combines exploration, combat, platforming and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Deep story told through notes, recordings and setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Collection of objects and usable tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0fVaried enemies and memorable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea Decisions that affect the way you play and your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to unravel the mystery... or will you be trapped forever?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madman\u2019s Maze is a first-person narrative and survival experience. Explore a vast labyrinth filled with traps, enemies and secrets as you face the horrors of a disturbed mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae More than 10 chapters with unique mechanics, puzzles, enemies and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Combines exploration, combat, platforming and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Deep story told through notes, recordings and setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Collection of objects and usable tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0fVaried enemies and memorable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea Decisions that affect the way you play and your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to unravel the mystery... or will you be trapped forever?</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter a first-person psychological labyrinth where madness and horror lurk around every corner. Will you make it out alive?",
